<section id="books">
  <div class="kicker">№ 01 · The Library</div>
  <h2>Books, <em>by Riley E. Antrobus</em>.</h2>
  <p class="lede">Speculative fiction — military-edge science fiction, creation myth, and the worlds in between. Editions sold through Amazon KDP.</p>

  <article class="book-card">
    <a class="book-card-cover" href="/books/warborn-protocols/fleet-school-dropout.html">
      <img src="/images/books/fleet-school-dropout.jpg" width="960" height="1536" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Fleet School Dropout book cover — Warborn Protocols Book 1, a girl in cadet uniform against a starfield">
    </a>
    <div class="book-card-body">
      <span class="num">№ 01 · <a href="/books/warborn-protocols/">Warborn Protocols</a>, Book 1</span>
      <h3><a href="/books/warborn-protocols/fleet-school-dropout.html">Fleet School Dropout</a></h3>
      <p class="tagline"><em>They trained her to follow orders. She learned to break them.</em></p>
      <p>Riko Vega — expelled cadet, bonded to a rogue war AI, and the spark that may reignite a war the Republic thought it buried.</p>
      <div class="editions">
        <a class="edition-btn primary" href="https://www.amazon.com/Fleet-School-Dropout-Warborn-Protocols-ebook/dp/B0FL4RQ33D/" rel="noopener">Kindle</a>
        <a class="edition-btn" href="https://www.amazon.com/Fleet-School-Dropout-Warborn-Protocols/dp/B0FMQD6KJW/" rel="noopener">Paperback</a>
