      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="book-card">
    <a class="book-card-cover" href="/books/warborn-protocols/network-recruit.html">
      <img src="/images/books/network-recruit.jpg" width="960" height="1536" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Network Recruit book cover — Warborn Protocols Book 2">
    </a>
    <div class="book-card-body">
      <span class="num">№ 02 · <a href="/books/warborn-protocols/">Warborn Protocols</a>, Book 2</span>
      <h3><a href="/books/warborn-protocols/network-recruit.html">Network Recruit</a></h3>
      <p class="tagline"><em>Choice is not a state you achieve. It is a practice you keep.</em></p>
      <p>Riko Vega extends her mind across intergalactic distance and finds the Harvest hiding inside a universe-scale Community.</p>
      <div class="editions">
        <a class="edition-btn primary" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H3T15VDM" rel="noopener">Kindle</a>
        <a class="edition-btn" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H3VJSF11" rel="noopener">Paperback</a>
