    <a class="book-card-cover" href="/books/echoes-of-yggdrasil/the-nine-bridges.html">
      <img src="/images/books/the-nine-bridges.jpg" width="960" height="1536" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="The Nine Bridges book cover — Echoes of Yggdrasil Book 1, a Norse urban fantasy beneath Chicago">
    </a>
    <div class="book-card-body">
      <span class="num">№ 03 · <a href="/books/echoes-of-yggdrasil/">Echoes of Yggdrasil</a>, Book 1</span>
      <h3><a href="/books/echoes-of-yggdrasil/the-nine-bridges.html">The Nine Bridges</a></h3>
      <p class="tagline"><em>Beneath Chicago, nine bridges hold the world together. One of them is breaking.</em></p>
      <p>Sixteen-year-old Astrid Eiriksen discovers a fracturing bridge beneath Union Station and a hidden Norse world tied to her missing mother.</p>
      <div class="editions">
        <a class="edition-btn primary" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H3SYFYZZ" rel="noopener">Kindle</a>
        <a class="edition-btn" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H3VFC8R3" rel="noopener">Paperback</a>
