      <span class="num">№ 05 · Standalone short story</span>
      <h3><a href="/books/weaving-eternal-tapestry.html">The Weaving of Eternal Tapestry</a></h3>
      <p class="tagline"><em>A creation myth — love, loss, and the weaving of spacetime.</em></p>
      <p>Before time, before space, two cosmic beings dream a universe into being — and learn what it costs to keep it from unravelling.</p>
      <div class="editions">
        <a class="edition-btn primary" href="https://www.amazon.com/Weaving-Eternal-Tapestry-Riley-Antrobus-ebook/dp/B0FQ3HWKPW/" rel="noopener">Kindle</a>
